    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<h2>Disciplined Fire</h2><p><em>It’s not about more shots. It’s about the right shot.</em></p><hr /><h3>Rules</h3><p>Once per turn when you hit with a ranged weapon attack, you may choose one:</p><ul><li><strong>Pin:</strong> The target’s movement is reduced by 2 squares until the start of your next turn.</li><li><strong>Disrupt:</strong> The next attack roll the target makes before the end of its next turn is Imposed (3d10 keep-lowest-2).</li></ul><p>A creature can be affected by this principle only once per round.</p><p class=\"ft-engine-note\"><em>🃏 Card — once per turn: Pin (noted) or Disrupt (target first → Imposed).</em></p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
